# Shipfeat MR comment queue

If **`.shipfeat/mr-comment-ready.json`** exists in this worktree:

1. **Before any other work**, read **`.shipfeat/pending-mr-comment-prompt.md`**.
2. Follow **`wasteos-mr-comment-watch`** — any **tracked** change (including file deletes) needs **commit + push** before GitLab resolve.
3. Before resolve: `require_branch_pushed.sh` must pass. Resolve only via `resolve_mr_discussion.sh`.
4. When the batch is fully handled:

```bash
"${SHIPFEAT_HOME:-$HOME/.config/wasteos/shipfeat}/scripts/require_branch_pushed.sh"
"${SHIPFEAT_HOME:-$HOME/.config/wasteos/shipfeat}/scripts/consume_mr_comment_prompt.sh"
```

Do not ignore the queue. Do not mark review work complete without running the consume script.
